# Build context is the repository root (npm workspaces hoist node_modules).
#
# Patterns without a leading ** match only at the context root, so every
# nested path needs its own ** form. Two bugs were caused by getting this
# wrong during F00:
#   1. apps/api/.env was copied into an image layer (secret leak).
#   2. Stale *.tsbuildinfo files were copied in, so TypeScript believed the
#      build was up to date, emitted nothing, and the image had no dist/.

# dependencies
node_modules
**/node_modules

# build output and incremental build caches
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
**/*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
**/coverage

# secrets - never in an image layer
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# not needed inside an image
.git
.gitignore
.github
docs
scripts
README.md
AI_LOG.md
**/Dockerfile
**/.dockerignore
docker-compose.yml
docker-compose.override.yml
*.log
